WEBVTT

00:08:30.163 --> 00:08:31.954
Charles had a shorter life.

00:08:31.996 --> 00:08:35.412
In 1855, he'd survived only to age 29.

00:08:36.162 --> 00:08:37.537
But these men were planters,

00:08:37.579 --> 00:08:40.329
and we know that they brought
enslaved people with them.

00:08:40.371 --> 00:08:41.621
Where were they buried?

00:08:41.662 --> 00:08:44.204
And what about the poor farmers
and the sharecroppers?

00:08:44.246 --> 00:08:47.454
There were more than 350 graves
in the cemetery.

00:08:47.496 --> 00:08:51.746
And so we decided to do our best
to solve these historic forensic cases

00:08:51.787 --> 00:08:54.412
and reconstruct the lives
of the people who lived there.

00:08:54.454 --> 00:08:56.746
And one of these people,
one of the migrants,

00:08:56.787 --> 00:08:58.954
was a man buried in grave 3.

00:08:58.996 --> 00:09:01.412
He was of African descent.